{
  "title": "Pentanuclear Heterometallic {MnIII2Ln3} (Ln = Gd, Dy, Tb, Ho) Assemblies in an Open-Book Type Structural Topology: Appearance of Slow Relaxation of Magnetization in the Dy(III) and Ho(III) Analogues",
